%%field Contact.email help: Business mailbox used for notices; shared mailboxes need not be globally unique.
%%field Contact.phone help: Direct number for urgent cut-off or delivery issues.
%%field Contact.responsibility help: Free description of the person’s remit, such as import documentation or accounts payable.
