%%section entity: CargoItem; name: Weight and handling; help: Record the lot’s mass and volume in fixed units before checking packing capacity.; rows: gross_weight_kg, net_weight_kg | volume_cbm, is_dangerous | temperature_controlled, temperature_celsius | handling_instructions
