%%field TransportLeg.booking_id help: Carrier capacity arrangement supporting this leg where one was booked.
%%field TransportLeg.voyage_id help: Ocean sailing used by this leg; empty for inland movement without an ocean voyage.
%%field TransportLeg.mode enum: Mode
%%field TransportLeg.mode help: ocean, road, rail or barge determines the movement’s operating context.
%%field TransportLeg.conveyance_reference help: Truck registration, train reference or barge name used where no vessel voyage identifies the conveyance.
