%%entity ContainerUse help: One container’s use for one booking and packing cycle. A returned container reused later receives another cycle record, preserving the earlier seal, VGM and free-time history.
%%field ContainerUse.reference help: Internal packing-cycle reference used to distinguish repeat uses of the same container number.
%%field ContainerUse.container_number help: ISO 6346 container number as painted on the unit; validate its check digit before external submission.
%%field ContainerUse.booking_id help: Carrier arrangement under which this packing cycle travels.
%%field ContainerUse.equipment_type_id help: Specification confirmed for this physical unit and its capacity checks.
%%field ContainerUse.seal_number help: Seal applied after packing; retain seal-change evidence rather than silently replacing the original.
%%field ContainerUse.status enum: ContainerStatus
%%field ContainerUse.status help: unit_expected awaits collection, unit_collected is empty in custody, unit_packed awaits verified loading, unit_shipped is aboard, unit_discharged awaits collection, unit_gated_out awaits return, and unit_returned or unit_cancelled ends the cycle.
%%field ContainerUse.tare_kg help: Tare marked on the actual container, not a generic equipment-type estimate.
%%field ContainerUse.verified_gross_kg help: Certified packed-container mass including cargo, dunnage and tare in kilograms.
%%field ContainerUse.vgm_method enum: VgmMethod
%%field ContainerUse.vgm_method help: method_one weighs the packed unit; method_two totals verified contents and actual tare under an approved method.
%%field ContainerUse.vgm_signatory help: Person authorised by the responsible shipper to sign the submitted VGM.
%%field ContainerUse.vgm_submitted_at help: UTC time VGM was transmitted to the required carrier and terminal recipients.
%%field ContainerUse.vgm_acknowledged help: Set only when required VGM receipt is evidenced for this loading arrangement.
%%field ContainerUse.setpoint_celsius help: Reefer set point accepted for this packing cycle, in Celsius.
%%field ContainerUse.empty_collected_at help: UTC time the empty unit left the nominated depot.
%%field ContainerUse.gate_in_at help: UTC terminal acceptance of the packed unit.
%%field ContainerUse.discharged_at help: UTC discharge time used where contractual free time begins at discharge.
%%field ContainerUse.gate_out_at help: UTC full-unit collection time used where detention starts after gate-out.
%%field ContainerUse.empty_return_due_at help: Contractually agreed UTC deadline for return, including the applicable free-time interpretation.
%%field ContainerUse.empty_returned_at help: Evidence-backed UTC empty return that stops the applicable equipment clock.
%%field ContainerUse.ownership enum: EquipmentOwnership
%%field ContainerUse.ownership help: carrier_owned uses carrier return instructions, shipper_owned uses the owner’s agreed movement terms, and leased follows the lessor’s return obligation.
%%field ContainerUse.owner_name help: Legal owner named in the equipment agreement, required where ownership changes return or customs responsibility.
%%section entity: ContainerUse; name: Packed unit; help: Match the physical box to the carrier arrangement and equipment specification.; rows: reference, container_number | booking_id, equipment_type_id | seal_number | ownership, owner_name
%%section entity: ContainerUse; name: Mass and special conditions; help: Confirm the actual packed unit’s safety evidence before loading.; rows: tare_kg, verified_gross_kg | vgm_method, vgm_signatory | vgm_submitted_at, vgm_acknowledged | setpoint_celsius
%%section entity: ContainerUse; name: Equipment handovers; help: Track chargeable custody and the return obligation for this same packing cycle.; rows: empty_collected_at, gate_in_at | discharged_at, gate_out_at | empty_return_due_at, empty_returned_at
%%rbac role:sales|operations|documentation|customs|warehouse|finance|management on ContainerUse.read
%%rbac role:operations|documentation|customs|warehouse|finance|management on ContainerUse.create
%%rbac role:operations|documentation|customs|warehouse|finance|management on ContainerUse.update
%%rbac role:management on ContainerUse.delete
%%index ContainerUse(booking_id)
%%index ContainerUse(equipment_type_id)
%%index ContainerUse(status)

