%%field Milestone.transport_leg_id help: Movement segment observed; verify it actually carries the selected shipment.
%%field Milestone.container_use_id help: Packing cycle observed where the event concerns a specific unit.
%%field Milestone.location_id help: Facility at which the reported event occurred.
%%field Milestone.event_kind enum: EventKind
