%%field Milestone.classifier enum: EventClassifier
%%field Milestone.classifier help: planned is a commitment, estimated is a prediction, and actual requires evidence that the event occurred.
%%field Milestone.occurred_at help: UTC event time in the source’s meaning, which may precede the time it was received.
