%%field CustomsFiling.bank_ad_code help: Authorised dealer or equivalent bank reference where this declaration requires one.
%%field CustomsFiling.filing_due_at help: UTC deadline confirmed for this movement under the current jurisdiction and registration category.
%%field CustomsFiling.submitted_at help: UTC transmission time for this exact version of the declaration.
%%field CustomsFiling.cleared_at help: UTC time the recorded authority clearance was received, distinct from carrier cargo release.
%%field CustomsFiling.submitted_snapshot help: Exact filed content or an authorised evidence reference, retained before subsequent correction.
%%field CustomsFiling.authority_response help: Acceptance, query or rejection text including error codes and required corrective action.
