%%field StorageCharge.storage_kind help: demurrage applies under the agreed inside-terminal clock, detention under the outside-terminal clock, terminal_storage under the facility tariff, and combined_free_time under a combined agreement.
%%field StorageCharge.currency_id help: Single currency for this assessed tariff segment.
%%field StorageCharge.clock_start_at help: UTC event from which this particular contractual charge clock is counted.
%%field StorageCharge.free_until_at help: Last free UTC instant under the reviewed day-counting and cut-off convention.
%%field StorageCharge.clock_stop_at help: UTC stopping event; empty while exposure continues to accrue.
