%%field Invoice.document_number help: Issued invoice or credit-note number as printed by the responsible party.
%%field Invoice.invoice_kind enum: InvoiceKind
%%field Invoice.invoice_kind help: receivable_invoice bills a customer, payable_invoice records a supplier debt, receivable_credit reduces customer debt, and payable_credit reduces supplier debt.
%%field Invoice.party_id help: Customer or supplier legally responsible for the invoice or credit note.
%%field Invoice.branch_id help: Office whose legal and tax details apply to this issued document.
%%field Invoice.invoice_id help: Original invoice adjusted by this credit note; empty on a normal invoice and never a link to itself.
%%field Invoice.currency_id help: Transaction currency shared by every line and the invoice’s open balance.
%%field Invoice.status enum: InvoiceStatus
%%field Invoice.status help: invoice_draft is editable, invoice_review awaits finance approval, invoice_posted is issued or recorded, invoice_partial has a residual cash balance, and invoice_settled or invoice_void is terminal.
%%field Invoice.issued_on help: Legal issue date on the document, used for tax periods and document ageing.
%%field Invoice.due_on help: Agreed payment due date; a credit note retains the applicable adjustment date rather than implying new cash is due.
%%field Invoice.functional_fx_rate help: Functional-currency units per one transaction-currency unit at posting, retained rather than recalculated from a live rate.
%%field Invoice.functional_currency_code help: ISO code of the legal entity’s reporting currency at posting; a snapshot rather than another party lookup.
%%field Invoice.net_amount help: Sum of line net amounts in transaction currency, stated positively for both invoices and credits; kind determines economic sign.
%%field Invoice.tax_amount help: Sum of reviewed line taxes in transaction currency.
%%field Invoice.gross_amount help: Net plus tax in transaction currency before cash allocation.
%%field Invoice.open_amount help: Positive unallocated invoice balance after posted cash and approved credits; derived by financial controls, not arbitrary edits.
%%field Invoice.approved_by_id help: Finance reviewer authorising posting and checking duplicate supplier numbering, line totals and tax evidence.
%%field Invoice.adjustment_reason help: Reason a credit or void is needed and the authorised treatment of the original document.
%%field Invoice.party_snapshot help: Frozen counterparty legal name, address and applicable tax identity printed or recorded at issue.
