%%section entity: Invoice; name: Issue and due date; help: Keep issued terms stable and explicitly record the functional-currency conversion basis.; rows: issued_on | due_on, functional_fx_rate | functional_currency_code
%%section entity: Invoice; name: Control totals; help: Totals in transaction currency are reconciled to the lines and allocations before posting or settlement.; rows: net_amount, tax_amount | gross_amount, open_amount | approved_by_id | adjustment_reason | party_snapshot
